{"id":"dd4032bef1975d25","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-exist.md","title":"任意有效 Hausdorff 维数的实现","display":"thm-dim-exist — 任意有效 Hausdorff 维数的实现","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-exist","aliases":["43-thm-dim-exist"],"display":"thm-dim-exist — 任意有效 Hausdorff 维数的实现","depends_on":["[[43-df-effhausdim]]","[[43-thm-dim-indep]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: consequence of Athreya–Hitchcock–Lutz–Mayordomo, Thm.6.5, PDF pp.15–17; https://arxiv.org/pdf/cs/0211025","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-exist"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-exist</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-exist — 任意有效 Hausdorff 维数的实现"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4b44981f101d27c\" href=\"?note=d4b44981f101d27c\" title=\"43-thm-dim-indep\">43-thm-dim-indep</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: consequence of Athreya–Hitchcock–Lutz–Mayordomo, Thm.6.5, PDF pp.15–17; <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/cs/0211025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/cs/0211025</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in[0,1]\">\\(s\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4b44981f101d27c\" href=\"?note=d4b44981f101d27c\" title=\"43-thm-dim-indep\">43-thm-dim-indep</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\,\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\dim_H(X)=s].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\,\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\dim_H(X)=s].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4b44981f101d27c\" href=\"?note=d4b44981f101d27c\" title=\"43-thm-dim-indep\">43-thm-dim-indep</a> 中 t=s，即得到任意实数参数 s∈[0,1] 的单维数实现，并且可以同时满足 packing 维数也等于 s。原论文精确 Thm.6.5 已逐项对照；这比所供2007稿 Cor.17.4.4 直接陈述的有理参数版本更强，明确作为书外补齐。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effhausdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-dim-indep","status":"resolved","id":"d4b44981f101d27c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-dim-indep]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in[0,1]$；见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-thm-dim-indep]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-dim-indep","status":"resolved","id":"d4b44981f101d27c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in[0,1]$；见 [[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-thm-dim-indep]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-dim-indep","status":"resolved","id":"d4b44981f101d27c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"将 [[43-thm-dim-indep]] 中 t=s，即得到任意实数参数 s∈[0,1] 的单维数实现，并且可以同时满足 packing 维数也等于 s。原论文精确 Thm.6.5 已逐项对照；这比所供2007稿 Cor.17.4.4 直接陈述的有理参数版本更强，明确作为书外补齐。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s\\in[0,1]\\,\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,[\\dim_H(X)=s].","display":true}],"bytes":1168,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-519","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dim-exist]] — 任意有效 Hausdorff 维数的实现"}],"outgoing":["2114b7d641739c3e","d4b44981f101d27c"]}